msgid "[IDNAME]"
msgstr ""

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@TOME@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of Blight"

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@TOME@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Unleash the virulent power of blight. Specialize in inflicting [hyperlink,"
"GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DISEASED]Disease[/hyperlink] and exploiting Diseased "
"enemies."

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@BLIGHT_DOCTOR@NAME"
msgstr "Blight Doctor"

#, fuzzy
msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@BLIGHT_DOCTOR@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "need to add Blight Doctor description"

#, fuzzy
msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@BLIGHT_SPORES@NAME"
msgstr "Blight Scourge"

#, fuzzy
msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@BLIGHT_SPORES@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Deals damage in a 1-hex radius.[bulletlist][bullet/]Inflict 3 {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.WEAKENED} if the target is {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DISEASED} or "
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DECAYING}.[bullet/]Base 90% chance of inflicting Diseased "
"if the target is not Diseased."

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@SKILL_01@NAME"
msgstr "Contagion"

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@SKILL_01@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Target a {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DISEASED} enemy unit. All adjacent enemy units:"
"[bulletlist][bullet/]Suffer {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.WEAKENED} per stack of "
"Weakened on the target.[bullet/]Suffer {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.POISONED} per "
"stack of Poisoned on the target.[bullet/]Suffer {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DECAYING} "
"per stack of Decaying on the target.[bullet/]This effect then spreads "
"through all adjacent units and is repeated, applying the effect to enemy "
"units it spreads to."

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@SKILL_02@NAME"
msgstr "Unraveling"

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@SKILL_02@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Target enemy {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.UNDEAD.Hyperlink}, {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"CONSTRUCT.Hyperlink} or {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.ETHEREAL.Hyperlink} unit:"
"[bulletlist][bullet/]Suffers 2 {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DECAYING.Hyperlink}"
"[bullet/]Suffers 4 {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SUNDERED_RESISTANCE.Hyperlink}."
"[bullet/]This effect then spreads through all adjacent units and is "
"repeated, applying the effect to enemy Undead, Construct and Ethereal units "
"it spreads to."

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@SKILL_03@NAME"
msgstr "Brew Plague"

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@SKILL_03@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"At the start of combat, units defending the city:[bulletlist][bullet/]Have "
"base 90% chance to suffer {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DISEASED}.[bullet/]Have base "
"90% chance to suffer {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DECAYING}."

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@SKILL_04@NAME"
msgstr "Disease Vectors"

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@SKILL_04@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Makes base attacks of enchanted units:[bulletlist][bullet/]Gain base 60% "
"chance of inflicting {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DISEASED}.[/bulletlist]\n"
"Effects [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EnchantingNonRepeatingConcept]are increased[/"
"hyperlink] for Single-Shot attacks."

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@SKILL_05@NAME"
msgstr "Blight Doctor"

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@SKILL_05@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Grants access to a {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BATTLE_MAGE.Hyperlink} that can "
"inflict [hyperlink,GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DISEASED]Disease[/hyperlink] and "
"devastate Diseased enemies."

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@SKILL_05@ATTACK@NAME"
msgstr "Plague Bolts"

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@SKILL_05@ATTACK@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Unleashes a magical bolt at target enemy.[bulletlist][bullet/]Deal "
"{PLAGUE_BOLT_JUMP_DAMAGE>DAMAGE>Blight} {GLOBAL.BlightDamageConcept."
"Hyperlink} and base {DISEASE_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance to inflict "
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DISEASED} to up to {PLAGUE_BOLT_JUMP_TARGETER>MaxJumps} "
"other enemy units within {PLAGUE_BOLT_JUMP_TARGETER>MaxDistance} hexes."

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@SKILL_05@ABILITY@NAME"
msgstr "Pestilence"

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@SKILL_05@ABILITY@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Deals damage in a 1-hex radius.[bulletlist][bullet/]Inflicts double damage "
"and an additional stack of {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.WEAKENED} and {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.POISONED} if the target is {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DISEASED} or "
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DECAYING}."

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@SKILL_05@ABILITY@NAME_MASTER"
msgstr "Champion Pestilence"

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@SKILL_05@ABILITY@DESCRIPTION_MASTER"
msgstr ""
"Pestilence:[bulletlist][bullet/]Also targets units in a 2-hex radius, with "
"50% reduced damage.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@SKILL_05@ABILITY@DESCRIPTION_2"
msgstr ""
"[bulletlist][bullet/]Inflicts double damage and an additional stack of "
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.WEAKENED} and {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.POISONED} if the target "
"is {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DISEASED} or {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DECAYING}."
"[bullet/]Also targets units in a 2-hex radius, with 50% reduced damage.[/"
"bulletlist]"

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@SKILL_05@ABILITY_02@NAME"
msgstr "Blight Extraction"

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@SKILL_05@ABILITY_02@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Target {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DISEASED} or {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DECAYING} friendly "
"unit:[bulletlist][bullet/]Has its <<m:{GLOBAL.NegativeStatusEffectConcept."
"Hyperlink}>> removed.[/bulletlist]\n"
"The caster gains:[bulletlist][bullet/]2 {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.STRENGTHENED} for "
"{STRENGTHENED_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>."

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@SKILL_05@ABILITY_02@NAME_MASTER"
msgstr "Champion Plague Bolts"

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@SKILL_05@ABILITY_02@DESCRIPTION_MASTER"
msgstr ""
"Unleashes a magical bolt at target enemy.[bulletlist][bullet/]Deal "
"{PLAGUE_BOLT_MASTER_JUMP_DAMAGE>DAMAGE>Blight} {GLOBAL.BlightDamageConcept."
"Hyperlink} and base {DISEASE_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance to inflict "
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DISEASED} to up to "
"{PLAGUE_BOLT_MASTER_JUMP_TARGETER>MaxJumps} other enemy units within "
"{PLAGUE_BOLT_MASTER_JUMP_TARGETER>MaxDistance} hexes."

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@SKILL_05@ABILITY_02@DESCRIPTION_MASTER_UPGRADE"
msgstr ""
"Plague Bolts:[bulletlist][bullet/]Always inflicts {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"DISEASED} to the primary target.[bullet/]Deal "
"{PLAGUE_BOLT_MASTER_JUMP_DAMAGE>DAMAGE>Blight} {GLOBAL.BlightDamageConcept."
"Hyperlink} and base {DISEASE_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance to inflict "
"Diseased to up to {PLAGUE_BOLT_MASTER_JUMP_TARGETER>MaxJumps} other enemy "
"units within {PLAGUE_BOLT_MASTER_JUMP_TARGETER>MaxDistance} hexes."

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@SKILL_06@NAME"
msgstr "placeholder 6"

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@SKILL_06@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "placeholder 6"

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@SPECIAL_PROVINCE_IMPROVEMENT@NAME"
msgstr "[researchpost/] Fungal Grove"

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@SPECIAL_PROVINCE_IMPROVEMENT@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"[bulletlist][bullet/] +20 {GLOBAL.FoodConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/] +4 "
"{GLOBAL.KnowledgeConcept.Hyperlink} and -4 {GLOBAL.FoodConcept.Hyperlink} "
"per adjacent {GLOBAL.ProvinceImprovementConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/] Spawns "
"2 {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DISEASED} {GLOBAL.UNITS.ENTWINED_THRALL_UNIT.Hyperlink} "
"on the owner's side for {GLOBAL.CombatConcept.Hyperlink} in this {GLOBAL."
"DomainConcept.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist] [bullet/]Counts as a {GLOBAL."
"ResearchPostConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@HERO_SKILL@NAME"
msgstr "Plague Herald"

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@HERO_SKILL@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Base attacks gain:[bulletlist][bullet/]+{PLAGUE_HERALD_DAMAGE>DAMAGE>Blight} "
"{GLOBAL.BlightDamageConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Gain base 60% chance of "
"inflicting {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DISEASED}.[/bulletlist]\n"
"Hero starts combat permanently Diseased, spreading it to nearby units."

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@TOME@LORE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"\"The villagers pray to the Shrine, as the newcomers have taught us. Still, "
"the rotted trees with leafless branches bloated with tumors continue to "
"spread. The animals have changed, as if the whole world is poisonous. My "
"father died yesterday. He was hunting giant boar. The animal they tracked "
"was infected. He weakened immediately; his flesh turned rancid. I pleaded at "
"the Shrine, but no healing came.\""

msgid "TOME_BLIGHT@TOME@LORE_AUTHOR"
msgstr "Petition to Commonwealth, Josua Hearts, Refugee"

